translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_43190bbe:

    # MC "(A letter?)"
    MC "(Uma carta?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:33
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_1031de16:

    # "{i}We've captured a baby slimelark as per the clients request, but the big one is getting more and more agitated.{/i}"
    "{i}Nós capturamos um filhote de slimelark conforme o pedido do cliente, mas o grande está ficando cada vez mais agitado.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:34
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_4d7ce016:

    # "{i}...Managed to hold it at bay for now, but-{/i}"
    "{i}...Consegui mantê-lo afastado por enquanto, mas-{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:35
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_dac4dbf1:

    # MC "(The rest of it is burned beyond readability.)"
    MC "(O resto está queimado demais para ser lido.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:36
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_6bf2865f:

    # MC "(I best stay away from the bank... For now at least.)"
    MC "(É melhor eu ficar longe do banco... Pelo menos por enquanto.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:40
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_camp_menu_c9614dee:

    # MC "(Let's move on.)"
    MC "(Vamos embora.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:49
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_9d3fcc85:

    # "As the lock dropped off the from the box, I opened it up to peer inside."
    "Quando o cadeado caiu da caixa, eu a abri para espiar dentro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:50
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_9ff2a2e4:

    # "Inside, a jar with an enchantment on it was filled with the slimelark-like substance."
    "Dentro, um jarro com um encantamento estava cheio da substância parecida com slimelark."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:51
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_2302ca8f:

    # MC "(This is what they came for.)"
    MC "(Era para isso que eles vieram.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:52
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_138ba29f:

    # MC "(A baby slimelark.)"
    MC "(Um bebê slimelark.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:53
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_a497c3f3:

    # MC "(Well, what should I do with it?)"
    MC "(Bem, o que devo fazer com ele?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:56
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_b4080175:

    # "While what happened here was no doubt horrific, something about punishing the youngling felt wrong."
    "Embora o que aconteceu aqui tenha sido sem dúvida horripilante, algo sobre punir o filhote parecia errado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:57
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_f3f2fecd:

    # "Even if it {i}was{/i} the offspring of a slimelark."
    "Mesmo que {i}fosse{/i} a prole de um slimelark."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:58
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_3fafabb6:

    # "With the jar in hand, I threw it straight into the lake, watching as it plumetted down with a splash."
    "Com o jarro na mão, o joguei direto no lago, observando enquanto ele despencava com um splash."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:61
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_407d78e6:

    # "Looking around at the horror inflicted by one of these beasts, I decided it was simply too much risk to keep it alive."
    "Olhando ao redor para o horror infligido por uma dessas bestas, decidi que era simplesmente risco demais mantê-la viva."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:62
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_f8ceeff3:

    # "It was young now... But it would grow up."
    "Era jovem agora... Mas cresceria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:63
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_7f274017:

    # "Shattering the glass, the slimelark squealed in a death cry as I hacked away at the thing till it dissolved like its parent."
    "Esmagando o vidro, o slimelark guinchou em um grito de morte enquanto eu retalhava a coisa até ela se dissolver como seu progenitor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:67
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_927f5c91:

    # "For some strange reason, I felt compelled to take the jar with me."
    "Por alguma razão estranha, me senti compelido a levar o jarro comigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:68
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_1a2610a5:

    # "Oddly, as I held up the jar to inspect it more, the colour of the slime briefly turned pink."
    "Estranhamente, enquanto eu segurava o jarro para inspecioná-lo mais, a cor da gosma brevemente ficou rosa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:69
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_94e3d87f:

    # "I thought for a moment I could hear a soft cooing sound from inside the jar, but after a few seconds more of inspection, the thing was silent again."
    "Pensei por um momento que podia ouvir um som suave de arrulho de dentro do jarro, mas após mais alguns segundos de inspeção, a coisa estava silenciosa novamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.rpy:71
translate ptBR qst_bloodhound_2_lake_openbox_156904e7:

    # MC "(I hope I don't end up regretting this.)"
    MC "(Espero não acabar me arrependendo disso.)"

